        "description": "New Update! 5 new free dance tracks have been added! Also, a new mode has been introduced where the lead dancer faces the players while dancing.\n\nDance Eden is a VR/MR dance game where you can dance alone or with other players, following the lead dancer in real-time.\n\n#  💃 A variety of dance styles\n55 free dance tracks are provided, with different styles, and each song comes in two difficulty levels—Regular and Hard.\n\n#  🎵 Immersive music and dance environments\nDance practice rooms, stages.\n\n#  🎮 Multiple dance modes\nYou can choose to have the lead dancer face you while dancing together, or have them face away from you, dancing towards a mirror.\n\n#  ✨ Personalized outfits\nThe game offers a vast array of carefully crafted clothing and makeup options for you to combine and match, allowing you to fully express your individual charm.\n\n{1450704885632015}{1280693556431475}{503758979089584}{1295298881549146}\n",
